+  - Process rectangles
+  - Start/end points
+  - Connectors with arrows
+- **Use Cases**:
+  - Math problem-solving steps
+  - Scientific method
+  - Grammar rules application
+  - Programming algorithms
+- **Implementation Priority**: Low (partially covered by diagram editor)
