+
+## Export Formats
+
+### Transcript Export (.md)
+
+Exports all content as a single Markdown file:
+- Page title and summary
+- All section content
+- Questions and answers
+
+### Anki Export (.txt)
+
+Exports questions in Anki-compatible format:
+```
+Question 1	Answer 1
+Question 2	Answer 2
+```
