+                        Gegeven: <span class="math-formula">P = 1000 \text{ W}</span>, <span class="math-formula">U = 230 \text{ V}</span>.<br />
+                        Formule: <span class="math-formula">I = P / U = 1000 / 230 \approx 4{,}35 \text{ A}</span>.
+                      </div>
+                    </div>
+                  </div>
+
+                </div>
